OL,3,GNEWSAChildren taken to hospital after
OL,4,Achemical fumes at Dublin pool
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dozen children taking swimming
OL,7,Flessons in a Dublin pool needed medical
OL,8,Fattention after the area was
OL,9,Fcontaminated by toxic fumes.
OL,11,FThe young people and one adult were
OL,12,Ftaken to hospital from the Clayton
OL,13,FHotel Liffey Valley on Thursday.
OL,15,FIn a statement the hotel said it would
OL,16,Fcarry out a "thorough investigation"
OL,17,Finto what happened.
OL,19,FIrish national broadcaster RTE reported
OL,20,Fthat a number of children were found to
OL,21,Fbe suffering "respiratory distress and
OL,22,Firritation".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
